MEOK WORM = 4 components:
  1. Morris-II worm guard (defensive)
  2. Protocol tunnel registry
  3. WORM (Write-Once-Read-Many) storage
  4. Sigil-signed audit chain

DOCTRINE: DEFENSIVE ONLY.
"NO offensive / self-propagating ('worm') capability — it contradicts
the safe-authority thesis and is out of scope." (SOVEREIGN_TOWN_POC_2026-06-19.md)

This package implements DEFENSE against AI worms (Morris II class),
not the worms themselves. It detects, quarantines, and audits.

References:
- Cohen, Bitton, Nassi — "Here Comes The AI Worm" (Morris II), arXiv:2403.02817
- sovereign-temple-public/security/worm_guard.py (309 lines, stdlib-only)
- sovereign-temple-public/security/WORM_GUARD_WIRING.md (the doctrine)
